    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<strong>Tank Strike is an intense top-down shooter, with the key objective of reigning havoc over all your enemies.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495480/extras/9d8ca4c5c045d71f04a655ae41d320eb.poster.avif?t=1718161581\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495480/extras/9d8ca4c5c045d71f04a655ae41d320eb.webm?t=1718161581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495480/extras/9d8ca4c5c045d71f04a655ae41d320eb.mp4?t=1718161581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Fight against and alongside leagues of tanks with one simple goal; win. Manage your army of AI tanks and create more of them with the in-game shop system.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495480/extras/24853bd94d7709bcbe1490a88bb1b257.poster.avif?t=1718161581\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495480/extras/24853bd94d7709bcbe1490a88bb1b257.webm?t=1718161581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495480/extras/24853bd94d7709bcbe1490a88bb1b257.mp4?t=1718161581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Take a break from the destruction and mayhem and build a world of your own. With many different and exciting game modes to chose from, there's always a new way to play. From defeating every enemy in sight, to defending a point of interest somewhere in the map, each game mode changes the strategy you must use to conquer your opponents and secure victory.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495480/extras/90a3f80744d8f0537dc451b9b88277e1.poster.avif?t=1718161581\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495480/extras/90a3f80744d8f0537dc451b9b88277e1.webm?t=1718161581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495480/extras/90a3f80744d8f0537dc451b9b88277e1.mp4?t=1718161581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Browse user created levels and challenge your friends to a battle with Tank Strike's PvP modes, or fight alongside them in the default PvE game modes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Singleplayer campaign<br></li><li>Multiplayer<br></li><li>Level editor<br></li><li>Online level browser<br></li><li>Many different gamemodes</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Tank Strike is an intense top-down shooter, with the key objective of reigning havoc over all your enemies.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495480/extras/9d8ca4c5c045d71f04a655ae41d320eb.poster.avif?t=1718161581\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495480/extras/9d8ca4c5c045d71f04a655ae41d320eb.webm?t=1718161581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495480/extras/9d8ca4c5c045d71f04a655ae41d320eb.mp4?t=1718161581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Fight against and alongside leagues of tanks with one simple goal; win. Manage your army of AI tanks and create more of them with the in-game shop system.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495480/extras/24853bd94d7709bcbe1490a88bb1b257.poster.avif?t=1718161581\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495480/extras/24853bd94d7709bcbe1490a88bb1b257.webm?t=1718161581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495480/extras/24853bd94d7709bcbe1490a88bb1b257.mp4?t=1718161581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Take a break from the destruction and mayhem and build a world of your own. With many different and exciting game modes to chose from, there's always a new way to play. From defeating every enemy in sight, to defending a point of interest somewhere in the map, each game mode changes the strategy you must use to conquer your opponents and secure victory.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495480/extras/90a3f80744d8f0537dc451b9b88277e1.poster.avif?t=1718161581\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495480/extras/90a3f80744d8f0537dc451b9b88277e1.webm?t=1718161581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495480/extras/90a3f80744d8f0537dc451b9b88277e1.mp4?t=1718161581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Browse user created levels and challenge your friends to a battle with Tank Strike's PvP modes, or fight alongside them in the default PvE game modes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Singleplayer campaign<br></li><li>Multiplayer<br></li><li>Level editor<br></li><li>Online level browser<br></li><li>Many different gamemodes</li></ul>",
